## What to deliver

Build the dropper sprite up operation by operation until the image in `canvas.png`
matches the brief — a compact amber data parcel with a down-chevron glyph, rising
speed-line trails, and a leading glow, symmetric about its center and clearly
falling downward, in the warm amber palette on full transparency. When you are
satisfied, stop: the recorded `actions.json` is your finished submission.
